{"title":"The Heavy Bow","html":"<article class=\"wp g-page\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">The Archery Vendor&#39;s crossbow stocks never reached Underleaf. The young hill giants in the valley tipped his cart over and carried them off.</p><section id=\"g-about\"><h2>About</h2><div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-facts\"><thead><tr><th></th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Given by</td><td><a href=\"#/npc/archery-vendor\">Archery Vendor</a> <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"npc\" data-map-id=\"archery-vendor\">Show on map</button></td></tr><tr><td>Level</td><td>11</td></tr><tr><td>Length</td><td>Medium</td></tr><tr><td>Kind</td><td>Combat skill unlocks</td></tr><tr><td>Quest points</td><td>3</td></tr><tr><td>Unlocks</td><td>The <a href=\"#/guide/special-attacks\">Crossbow</a> weapon skill</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section id=\"g-needs\"><h2>What you need</h2><ul class=\"q-needs\"><li><a href=\"#/item/stolen-crossbow-stock\"><img class=\"g-ico\" src=\"data/img/fe2d50053314a4fc79b4.svg\" alt=\"\">Stolen Crossbow Stock</a> <b>×6</b></li></ul></section><section id=\"g-steps\"><h2>Steps</h2><ol class=\"q-steps\"><li value=\"1\">Talk to <a href=\"#/npc/archery-vendor\">Archery Vendor</a> <span class=\"muted\">(outdoors near Underleaf)</span> to get the quest. <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"npc\" data-map-id=\"archery-vendor\">Show on map</button></li><li value=\"2\">Bring 6 stolen crossbow stocks to the Archery Vendor <span class=\"muted\">(6)</span> - <a href=\"#/item/stolen-crossbow-stock\"><img class=\"g-ico\" src=\"data/img/fe2d50053314a4fc79b4.svg\" alt=\"\">Stolen Crossbow Stock</a> <span class=\"muted\">at -31, 206</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"spot\" data-map-id=\"-31|206|Bring 6 stolen crossbow stocks to the Archery Vendor\">Show on map</button></li><li value=\"3\">Kill 5 hill giant youths <span class=\"muted\">(5)</span></li><li value=\"4\">Report to the Archery Vendor <span class=\"muted\">at -31, 206</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"spot\" data-map-id=\"-31|206|Report to the Archery Vendor\">Show on map</button></li></ol></section><section id=\"g-rewards\"><h2>Rewards</h2><div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-rewards\"><thead><tr><th>Reward</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Gold</td><td>350</td></tr><tr><td>Character XP</td><td>16,000</td></tr><tr><td>Crossbow XP</td><td>279</td></tr><tr><td>Quest points</td><td>3</td></tr><tr><td>Items</td><td><a href=\"#/item/pine-crossbow\"><img class=\"g-ico\" src=\"data/img/92791e4126434fe0d310.svg\" alt=\"\">Pine Crossbow</a><br><a href=\"#/item/bolt\"><img class=\"g-ico\" src=\"data/img/b4362887a1f8d7b3462f.svg\" alt=\"\">Bolt</a> ×100</td></tr><tr><td>Unlocks</td><td>the <a href=\"#/guide/special-attacks\">Crossbow</a> weapon skill</td></tr></tbody></table></div><h3>Unlocks</h3><p>The <b><a href=\"#/guide/special-attacks\">Crossbow</a> weapon skill</b>: this quest is how you learn it (the crossbow tome is retired). Once you have it you can wield crossbows, the skill levels with the damage you deal, and it unlocks five special attacks along the way.</p></section></div>\n      <aside class=\"wp-infobox g-aside\"><h3>The Heavy Bow</h3><p class=\"g-aside-group\">Quests</p><p class=\"g-aside-h\">On this page</p><ol class=\"g-toc\"><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-underleaf-the-heavy-bow\" data-g-jump=\"g-about\">About</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-underleaf-the-heavy-bow\" data-g-jump=\"g-needs\">What you need</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-underleaf-the-heavy-bow\" data-g-jump=\"g-steps\">Steps</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-underleaf-the-heavy-bow\" data-g-jump=\"g-rewards\">Rewards</a></li></ol><p class=\"g-aside-h\">Related guides</p><ul class=\"g-toc\"><li><a href=\"#/guide/quests\">All quests</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/travel\">Travel &amp; quests</a></li></ul><p class=\"g-aside-h\"><a href=\"#/guides\">All guides</a></p><p class=\"g-note\">From the game’s own data, what players have recorded, and the <a href=\"https://binxonia.com/guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">official guide</a>.</p></aside></article>"}